hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16137","Aswad ibn Amir narrated to us, he said: Muslim ibn Khalid narrated to us, from Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini, from his father, from Shuqran, the freedman of the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), he said: I saw him, meaning the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), heading to Khaybar on a donkey, praying on it, gesturing with gestures."
